1
00:00:00,839 --> 00:00:03,669
- Lobsters overnight?
- You're kidding. Let me see.

2
00:00:03,842 --> 00:00:08,212
(Howard:)Well, I'll be. Look, you can throw in
a couple steaks and have a surf and turf.

3
00:00:09,347 --> 00:00:12,507
(Leonard:)Surf and turf sounds good.
See if they have corn on the cob.

4
00:00:14,019 --> 00:00:17,819
(Bernadette:)Guys, we're trying to get
him out of here, not you in.

5
00:00:18,457 --> 00:00:22,787
(Raj:)You're wasting your time.
Just please, leave me alone.

6
00:00:26,965 --> 00:00:29,525
- Now what?
- I don't know.

7
00:00:30,268 --> 00:00:32,858
(Bernadette:)We could go to Red Lobster
and talk about it.

8
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:39,040
(Bernadette:)We're all thinking it. I just had
the decency to wait for him to leave.

9
00:00:46,384 --> 00:00:48,354
- Hello, Sheldon.
- Hello.

10
00:00:48,887 --> 00:00:52,187
(Sheldon:)How's the final stage of your
nicotine addiction study going?

11
00:00:53,558 --> 00:00:54,888
(Amy:)Fine.

12
00:00:55,060 --> 00:01:00,020
(Amy:)Just hold on.
Mommy's on the phone!

